<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in bigger turnover.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in bigger turnover.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex closed higher, Universal lower and two stocks were flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>Total turnover rose to 1.7 million zlotys from 0.5 million zlotys on Friday.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 5.2 percent to 121 zlotys in a turnover of eight million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
